sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant A as FastAPI
    participant Q as Queue
    participant W as Worker
    C->>A: POST /runs + Idempotency-Key
    A->>Q: enqueue(run_id)
    A-->>C: 202 queued
    W->>Q: claim
    W->>W: Agent + checkpoint
    W-->>A: progress events
    C->>A: GET /runs/{id}/events
    A-->>C: SSE progress/tool/final/error
